    "summary": "The Norn Assimilator’s **[Harpooned](vsdata:ability/core.harpooned)** ability can affect an enemy **MONSTER** or **VEHICLE** within 12″ that the Assimilator hit with a harpoon attack earlier that turn. If the Assimilator uses the ability when charging, add +2 to its [Charge rolls](vsdata:core-rule/charge-phase) through phase end. Its [Charge move](vsdata:core-rule/charge-move) must end engaging the harpooned enemy.",
